# ...except the licence VERIFYING key. It ships with the product on purpose:
# it can check a licence and never mint one, and without it an installation
# with AUDITBOX_ENFORCE_ENTITLEMENTS=1 fails closed and refuses every
# framework. The blanket *.pem above kept it out of the image entirely.
!config/licence_public.pem
.tmp-*
backups/
logs/
node_modules/
test-results/
playwright-report/
samples/AICyberAuditOPS Sample Data/
docker/cache/
